	text: [
		"The Blood Altar is the main crafting mechanic of Blood Magic - It infuses Life Essence (Blood) into items to transform them.\n\nIt's a multiblock structure that gets bigger with each tier. The Tier 6 altar, although not having specific recipes, is 23x9x23, so you should make plenty of room when preparing to build it. You can use the §4Inspectoris Scandalum§r to visualize where the runes and such should be placed.\n\nSee the Sanguine Scientiem for details."
